  "title": "GIOP: Fix evaluation order violation",
  "description": "In C, the evaluation order of function arguments is undefined. It\nhappens to be that most compilers on x86 and x86_64 evaulate function\nargments right-to-left, as assumed here, but that is not guaranteed\n(and might be different on other architectures.)\n\nCoverity CID 1551023",
